    "text": "Index of codices detailing affinities among Milanese manuscripts, with folio correspondences and notes of dates found in Codices 2 and 22. It identifies Sebastianus Thomas Corcyrensis as scribe of Codex 2 and <Iohannes> Docianus as possessor and possibly scribe of Codex 22."
